    # "Dejectedly, Myu sadly slumped her way out of my tent, leaving me alone for the evening."
    "Mutlos schlurfte Myu traurig aus meinem Zelt und ließ mich für den Abend allein."

# game/data/travel_events/camp/camp_myu_elena_sex.rpy:75
translate de travel_event_camp_myu_elena_3ef1dfb5_1:

